# move — fail
#
# The move verb attempted and missed: checks pass, the dice do not.
#
# Reached in 12/12 of the sampled location ids.
#
# FLAGS: --playground --skip-childhood --debug --seed 42 --no-encounters --auto-dialogue --location-type test --location-id 0 --start-area "Test Field" --period dawn --observe-only "Test Yard"

wait
click menu New
wait mode ProtagonistCreation 20
click continue
wait mode WorldView 60
travel here
wait mode LocationInteraction 60

strategy fail-dice
goal move
advance 12 180
regions

click keyword 0
choose 0
choose 0
advance 12 180
regions

click action 0
choose 0
advance 12 180
click continue
advance 12 180

expect FAILURE

# What makes this a move test rather than an any-verb test.
expect-verb move
quit
